Z||000000||zeusrekning||06-08-99||08:01 PM||||Does anyone have dimensions for a bandpass box to put in the front hood compartment?
Z||000001||Lynx||06-10-99||12:37 AM||||First the best way is to take it to a stereo store. The best way is for them to build one in the car with fiberglass and wood. I guess you could build one and shove it in the but you have to port it into the inside of the car. Yes the stereo store route is a little spendy but if you want it done right and to sound good thats the way to go.
